{{!
    @template tool_vae/positioning_structure

    The archive of the structure in the dossier: a paragraph that says which archive is in place, followed by the link that
    downloads it; a paragraph with the button that produces a new one. Each only for whoever may.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\positioning_structure. The template holds no logic.
    Every value is escaped (double braces): none of them is HTML.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * current - object or null: text (which archive is in place), url and label (the link that downloads it)
    * issue - object or null: url and label (the button that produces a new archive)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "current": {
            "text": "Archive of the structure in place: produced on 4 November 2026, number 01JB0000000000000000000000.",
            "url": "https://example.com/pluginfile.php/5/tool_vae/structurearchive/0/structure.pdf?forcedownload=1",
            "label": "Download it"
        },
        "issue": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/structure.php?userid=7", "label": "Produce the archive"}
    }
}}
{{#current}}<p>{{text}} <a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a></p>{{/current}}{{!
}}{{#issue}}<p><a href="{{url}}" class="btn btn-secondary">{{label}}</a></p>{{/issue}}
